  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 225 * 15 * 10 * 50 * 25 * 125\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) + , ×, – , ÷ , =\n\n225 * 15 * 10 * 50 * 25 * 125 ⇒ 225 + 15 × 10 - 50 ÷ 25 = 125\n\n⇒ 225 + 15 × 10 - __**50 **____**÷**____** 25**__ = 125\n\n⇒ 225 + __**15 **____**×**____** 10**__ - 2 = 125\n\n⇒ __**225 + 15**____**0**__ - 2 = 125\n\n⇒ **__375__**__** - 2**__ = 125\n\n⇒ 373 ≠ 125 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ÷ , ×, + , – , =\n\n225 * 15 * 10 * 50 * 25 * 125 ⇒ 225 ÷ 15 × 10 + 50 - 25 = 125\n\n⇒ __**225 ÷**____** 15**__ × 10 + 50 - 25 = 125\n\n⇒ __**15 ×**____** 10**__ + 50 - 25 = 125\n\n⇒ __**15**____**0 +**____** 50**__ - 25 = 125\n\n⇒ __**20**____0** - 25**__ = 125\n\n⇒ 175 ≠ 125 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) ÷ , + , – , ×, =\n\n225 * 15 * 10 * 50 * 25 * 125 ⇒ 225 ÷ 15 + 10 - 50 × 25 = 125\n\n⇒ __**225 ÷**____** 15**__ + 10 - 50 × 25 = 125\n\n⇒ 15 + 10 - __**50 **____**×**____** 25**__ = 125\n\n⇒ __**15 + 10**__ - 1250 = 125\n\n⇒ __60** - 1250**__ = 125\n\n⇒ -1190 ≠ 125 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) ÷ , ×, – , + , =\n\n225 * 15 * 10 * 50 * 25 * 125 ⇒ 225 ÷ 15 × 10 - 50 + 25 = 125\n\n⇒ __**225 ÷**____** 15**__ × 10 - 50 + 25 = 125\n\n⇒ __**15 ×**____** 10**__ - 50 + 25 = 125\n\n⇒ __**15**____**0 + 25**__ - 50 = 125\n\n⇒ __17____5** - 50**__ = 125\n\n**⇒ 125 = 125 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
